From beb08ac746cf6b524217e07aa0fcef638306ca0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: S Y Kim <sykimesq@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:12:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(delegation): support agent profile model routing

Add per-task model routing via delegation.agent_profiles in config.yaml.
Each subagent in a batch can use a different provider/model by naming
a profile from config.yaml via the 'agent' or 'profile' parameter.

- _PROFILE_MERGE_KEYS: strict allow-list of 7 routing keys
- _get_profile_config(): lookup profile by name (safe fallback)
- _merge_delegation_profile(): merge profile keys into base creds
- delegate_task() gains agent/profile params; per-task resolution
- DELEGATE_TASK_SCHEMA exposes agent/profile (not provider/model)
- 15 new tests: TestAgentProfileRouting + TestDelegateSchemaProfileFields
